# class: clearances
# twin-of: masked-route-balcony-door
# origin: audits/2026-10-18-first-contact.md A2 with the sofa and table moved 500 mm east
# expect: none
# fact: the west gap is 900 mm (sofa x 2950-5150, table x 5150-7700); with d_bal made a window, describe measures the
#   laundry from d_front at 740 mm and lint is silent
plan "Pinched route to the laundry, masked by the balcony door" {
  units mm
  grid 50
  wall id=shell exterior thickness 200 { (0,0) (8000,0) (8000,6000) (0,6000) close }
  wall id=w_a partition thickness 100 { (2000,0) (2000,6000) }
  wall id=w_b partition thickness 100 { (0,3000) (2000,3000) }
  room id=r_hall at (0,0) size 2000x3000 label "Hall" uses hall
  room id=r_laun at (0,3000) size 2000x3000 label "Laundry" uses utility
  room id=r_liv at (2000,0) size 6000x6000 label "Living Room" uses living
  door id=d_front at (1000,0) width 900 wall shell
  door id=d_liv at (2000,1500) width 900 wall w_a swing into r_liv
  door id=d_laun at (2000,4800) width 800 wall w_a swing into r_laun
  door id=d_bal sliding at (5500,6000) width 2000 wall shell
  window at (5000,0) width 1500 wall shell
  outdoor id=o_bal balcony at (4400,6100) size 2200x1200 label "Balcony" rail left right bottom
  furniture sofa at (2950,3000) size 2200x900 label "Sofa"
  furniture table at (5150,3000) size 2550x450
}
